	"transcription": [
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:00,000",
				"to": "00:00:07,100"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 0,
				"to": 7100
			},
			"text": " This question comes from Jonathan, who asks, \"What if I took a swim in a typical spent"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:07,100",
				"to": "00:00:08,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 7100,
				"to": 8520
			},
			"text": " nuclear fuel pool?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:08,520",
				"to": "00:00:11,620"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 8520,
				"to": 11620
			},
			"text": " Would I need to dive to actually experience a fatal amount of radiation?"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:11,620",
				"to": "00:00:15,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 11620,
				"to": 15760
			},
			"text": " How long could I safely stay at the surface?\""
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:15,760",
				"to": "00:00:18,860"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 15760,
				"to": 18860
			},
			"text": " The short answer is that, assuming you're a reasonably good swimmer, you could probably"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:18,860",
				"to": "00:00:21,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 18860,
				"to": 21740
			},
			"text": " tread water anywhere from 10 to 40 hours."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:21,740",
				"to": "00:00:24,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 21740,
				"to": 24000
			},
			"text": " At that point, you'd blackout from fatigue and drown."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:24,000",
				"to": "00:00:27,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 24000,
				"to": 27220
			},
			"text": " This is also true for a pool without nuclear fuel at the bottom."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:27,220",
				"to": "00:00:29,740"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 27220,
				"to": 29740
			},
			"text": " And it's not really the question Jonathan was asking."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:29,740",
				"to": "00:00:33,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 29740,
				"to": 33800
			},
			"text": " Spent fuel from nuclear reactors is indeed highly radioactive and it's also hot."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:33,800",
				"to": "00:00:37,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 33800,
				"to": 37520
			},
			"text": " Water is good for both radiation shielding and for cooling, so fuel is stored at the"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:37,520",
				"to": "00:00:41,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 37520,
				"to": 41600
			},
			"text": " bottom of pools for a couple of decades until it's inert enough to be moved into dry casks."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:41,600",
				"to": "00:00:44,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 41600,
				"to": 44920
			},
			"text": " We haven't really agreed on where to put spent nuclear fuel yet."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:44,920",
				"to": "00:00:46,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 44920,
				"to": 46880
			},
			"text": " One of these days we should probably figure that out."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:46,880",
				"to": "00:00:49,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 46880,
				"to": 49040
			},
			"text": " But Jonathan asked about swimming in the pool."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:49,040",
				"to": "00:00:52,000"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 49040,
				"to": 52000
			},
			"text": " Here's the geometry of a typical fuel storage pool."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:52,000",
				"to": "00:00:53,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 52000,
				"to": 53880
			},
			"text": " The heat from the fuel wouldn't be a big problem."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:53,880",
				"to": "00:00:58,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 53880,
				"to": 58080
			},
			"text": " The water temperature in a fuel pool can in theory go as high as 50 degrees C, but in practice"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:00:58,080",
				"to": "00:01:00,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 58080,
				"to": 60840
			},
			"text": " they're typically between 25 and 35 degrees."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:00,840",
				"to": "00:01:03,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 60840,
				"to": 63520
			},
			"text": " Warmer than most pools, but cooler than a hot tub."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:03,520",
				"to": "00:01:06,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 63520,
				"to": 66920
			},
			"text": " But Jonathan asked specifically about the effects of radiation."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:06,920",
				"to": "00:01:10,840"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 66920,
				"to": 70840
			},
			"text": " For the kinds of radiation coming off of spent nuclear fuel, every 7 centimeters of water"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:10,840",
				"to": "00:01:12,820"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 70840,
				"to": 72820
			},
			"text": " cuts the amount of radiation in half."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:12,820",
				"to": "00:01:16,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 72820,
				"to": 76640
			},
			"text": " This absorption means that 2 meters away from the fuel there is a billionth as much radiation"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:16,640",
				"to": "00:01:20,860"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 76640,
				"to": 80860
			},
			"text": " as directly adjacent to it, and 2 meters farther away than that there is a billionth again"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:20,860",
				"to": "00:01:21,860"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 80860,
				"to": 81860
			},
			"text": " as much."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:21,860",
				"to": "00:01:26,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 81860,
				"to": 86040
			},
			"text": " The most highly radioactive fuel rods are those that are recently removed from a reactor."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:26,040",
				"to": "00:01:30,400"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 86040,
				"to": 90400
			},
			"text": " Based on the activity levels provided by Ontario Hydro in a report, these are the regions of"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:30,400",
				"to": "00:01:33,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 90400,
				"to": 93240
			},
			"text": " danger and safety for fresh fuel rods."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:33,240",
				"to": "00:01:36,920"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 93240,
				"to": 96920
			},
			"text": " Swimming to the bottom, touching your elbows to a fresh fuel canister and then immediately"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:36,920",
				"to": "00:01:39,440"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 96920,
				"to": 99440
			},
			"text": " swimming back up could be enough to kill you."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:39,440",
				"to": "00:01:43,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 99440,
				"to": 103560
			},
			"text": " Yet outside the safe dose boundary, you could swim around as long as you wanted."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:43,560",
				"to": "00:01:46,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 103560,
				"to": 106660
			},
			"text": " The dose from the rods would be less than the normal background dose of radiation you"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:46,660",
				"to": "00:01:48,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 106660,
				"to": 108960
			},
			"text": " get from cosmic rays and stuff walking around."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:48,960",
				"to": "00:01:53,020"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 108960,
				"to": 113020
			},
			"text": " In fact, as long as you were underwater, you'd be shielded from most of that normal background"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:53,020",
				"to": "00:01:54,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 113020,
				"to": 114040
			},
			"text": " dose as well."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:54,040",
				"to": "00:01:58,280"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 114040,
				"to": 118280
			},
			"text": " So you might receive a lower dose of radiation treading water in a spent fuel pool than walking"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:58,280",
				"to": "00:01:59,680"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 118280,
				"to": 119680
			},
			"text": " around on the street."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:01:59,680",
				"to": "00:02:00,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 119680,
				"to": 120880
			},
			"text": " At least in theory."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:00,880",
				"to": "00:02:04,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 120880,
				"to": 124800
			},
			"text": " If there's corrosion in the spent fuel rod casings, there might be some fission products"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:04,800",
				"to": "00:02:05,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 124800,
				"to": 125960
			},
			"text": " in the water."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:05,960",
				"to": "00:02:09,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 125960,
				"to": 129640
			},
			"text": " Spent fuel facilities generally do a pretty good job of keeping the water clean, but it's"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:09,640",
				"to": "00:02:12,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 129640,
				"to": 132360
			},
			"text": " radioactive enough that it wouldn't be legal to sell it as bottled water."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:12,360",
				"to": "00:02:15,220"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 132360,
				"to": 135220
			},
			"text": " Which is too bad, because that'd be an amazing energy drink."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:15,220",
				"to": "00:02:18,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 135220,
				"to": 138800
			},
			"text": " We know spent fuel pools can be safe-ish to swim in because they're routinely serviced"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:18,800",
				"to": "00:02:22,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 138800,
				"to": 142720
			},
			"text": " by human divers, however these divers do have to be careful."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:22,720",
				"to": "00:02:27,640"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 142720,
				"to": 147640
			},
			"text": " On August 31, 2010, a diver was servicing the spent fuel pool at the Leibstadt Nuclear"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:27,640",
				"to": "00:02:29,080"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 147640,
				"to": 149080
			},
			"text": " Reactor in Switzerland."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:29,080",
				"to": "00:02:32,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 149080,
				"to": 152600
			},
			"text": " He spotted an unidentified length of tubing at the bottom of the pool and asked his supervisor"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:32,600",
				"to": "00:02:33,600"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 152600,
				"to": 153600
			},
			"text": " what to do."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:33,600",
				"to": "00:02:36,120"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 153600,
				"to": 156120
			},
			"text": " He was told to put it in his tool basket, which he did."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:36,120",
				"to": "00:02:39,620"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 156120,
				"to": 159620
			},
			"text": " Due to bubble noise in the pool, he didn't hear his radiation alarm."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:39,620",
				"to": "00:02:43,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 159620,
				"to": 163200
			},
			"text": " When the tool basket was lifted toward the surface, the room's radiation alarms went"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:43,200",
				"to": "00:02:44,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 163200,
				"to": 164200
			},
			"text": " off."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:44,200",
				"to": "00:02:46,360"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 164200,
				"to": 166360
			},
			"text": " The basket was dropped back down and the diver left the pool."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:46,360",
				"to": "00:02:49,660"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 166360,
				"to": 169660
			},
			"text": " The diver's dosimeter badges showed that he received a higher than normal whole body"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:49,660",
				"to": "00:02:53,720"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 169660,
				"to": 173720
			},
			"text": " dose of radiation, and the dose in his right hand was extremely high."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:53,720",
				"to": "00:02:57,520"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 173720,
				"to": 177520
			},
			"text": " The object turned out to be a piece of protective tubing from a radiation monitor in the reactor"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:02:57,520",
				"to": "00:03:00,240"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 177520,
				"to": 180240
			},
			"text": " core made highly radioactive by neutron flux."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:00,240",
				"to": "00:03:03,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 180240,
				"to": 183960
			},
			"text": " The tubing in question had been disassembled in 2006, but a piece accidentally broke off"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:03,960",
				"to": "00:03:08,760"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 183960,
				"to": 188760
			},
			"text": " and sank to a remote corner of the pool floor, where it sat unnoticed for four years."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:08,760",
				"to": "00:03:12,560"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 188760,
				"to": 192560
			},
			"text": " The tubing was so radioactive that if the diver had tucked it into a tool belt or shoulder"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:12,560",
				"to": "00:03:15,200"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 192560,
				"to": 195200
			},
			"text": " bag close to his body, he could have been killed."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:15,200",
				"to": "00:03:16,960"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 195200,
				"to": 196960
			},
			"text": " As it was, the water protected him."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:16,960",
				"to": "00:03:20,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 196960,
				"to": 200880
			},
			"text": " And only his hand, which is a body part more resistant to radiation than the delicate internal"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:20,880",
				"to": "00:03:23,040"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 200880,
				"to": 203040
			},
			"text": " organs, received a heavy dose."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:23,040",
				"to": "00:03:26,880"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 203040,
				"to": 206880
			},
			"text": " So as far as swimming safety goes, the bottom line is that you'd probably be okay as long"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:26,880",
				"to": "00:03:30,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 206880,
				"to": 210800
			},
			"text": " as you didn't dive to the bottom, or pick up anything strange, or drink too much of"
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:30,800",
				"to": "00:03:31,800"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 210800,
				"to": 211800
			},
			"text": " the water."
		},
		{
			"timestamps": {
				"from": "00:03:31,800",
				"to": "00:03:35,160"
			},
			"offsets": {
				"from": 211800,
				"to": 215160
